# TASK/ACCTITLE regression, QED (#Z C:\Apps\QED\QED.NAP) with the card's
# two accessories registered: hover "Desk" (26,9) -> the application's Desk
# drop-down, which menu_fixup filled with the accessory entries (their
# ob_spec = the published title page); click the first accessory entry
# (60,66) -> AC_OPEN -> SYSACC's form_alert; Return closes it.
# Ticks hz_200 after the injector arms = the first EL0 program, here the
# first accessory (session start), so the application is given 3600 ticks.
100 parkbr
3600 mark Q00_UP
3700 move 26 9
4100 mark Q01_DESK_OPEN
4200 move 60 66
4400 down
4403 up
5400 mark Q02_ACC_OPENED
5600 key 1C
5606 key 9C
6200 mark Q03_ALERT_CLOSED
6300 parkbr
6600 mark END
